  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Yixing Pumped Storage Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the proposed project is to increase the overall efficiency of the power sector in Jiangsu  Province in two ways: (a) Through the design and implementation of a far-reaching restructuring of the sector to further competition at the generation level and to provide large consumers access to generators (by promoting the transition from a monopoly-monopsony structure to an unbundled competitive structure: wholesale market by end 2005 and eventually retail market by 2012). (b) Through the construction of a pumped storage plant (4 x 250 MW) and associated transmnission in Yixing to ease acute peaking problems and improve the generation mix that would create the conditions for more flexible dispatch and improved supply reliability, an essential requirement for well-functioning competitive markets.</narrative>
  </description>
